cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or mention this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MINT Final Channel"
abstract: >-
  MINT Final Channel is a free, open-source, bilingual (English/Chinese)
  channel-strip VST3 plug-in with a Simple view for streaming and a Formal view
  with 12-band EQ, spectral denoising, compression, FDN reverb and true-peak
  limiting. All audio is processed locally.
